msgstr "`pydub`、一部形式は `ffmpeg` が必要"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:247 b331f969e02a4018ada1201ac67f30f6
msgid ""
"Purpose: highlight logger-specific and audio-specific direct-I/O "
